OL,4,Astocks rally after Jensen Huang returns
OL,6,FTech stocks more broadly have also     
OL,7,Frallied following large falls on       
OL,8,FFriday, with much of the rally starting
OL,9,Fin pre-market trading before Huang's   
OL,10,Freturn was announced.                  
